{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-online-banking-slovakia-react-native-drop-in","reason":"Independently read all 398 pinned raw lines, verified SHA-256, accepted receipt/candidate/suggestions equality, all five quotes, overview, route and Q1/Q2. The candidate correctly preserves Sessions v68+, Advanced required issuer, redirect handling, setup and test/live boundaries, and flags the Sessions base-link and Go version mismatch. One cross-page issuer conflict remains material: this child repeatedly uses `issuer: cs` in its Advanced requests (raw lines 95\u201399 and 123\u2013125), but the approved API-only guide instructs merchants to select an issuer from `/paymentMethods` and its captured bank table lists `bliksk`, `vub`, `posta`, `sporo`, `tatra`, `viamo`, with no `cs` (API-only raw lines 44\u201359). A user asking what issuer to send could copy `cs` from this source without seeing the discrepancy. The current 'example, not exhaustive' qualifier does not identify that mismatch. The reciprocal concept source route is suitable."}
